{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H5 的身体松动与 H6 对相处时长和珍惜之情的确认，足以支撑暂时放松、注意力游移的局部心理过程；没有把音乐变化当作心理原因，也没有新增事件或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"M38 的身体先行冲动与 M39 的急切回落，接上了 H6 的珍惜和 H2 的悬念；想要倾诉却未能形成表达属于允许的局部心理过程，并未声称实际发生了倾诉或其他新事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"M23 提供了在意对方是否知晓自己心意的既有候选，H2、H4、H6 支撑不确定与珍惜，M31 则被转化为内在追问受阻的心理过程，没有断言发生了新的实际追问或改变主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条都清楚交代了当下感受及其心理成因，从身体松动、舍不得引发的冲动到不确定带来的思绪滞留，因果链条完整，不依赖听感记录也能读懂。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "26dffd6a-3ad3-4a4e-b996-0d44fc382a5b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T143828553183Z", "elapsed_seconds": 218.594, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:42:07.155013+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9aab176f2f268fbfdc6849a1fe9241a844d41059c61be8f565fd261a68092baf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "596888